<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-ICI deferred shares start at A$12.49.</title>
<headline>RTRS-ICI deferred shares start at A$12.49.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in the public offer of ICI Plc's stake in ICI Australia Ltd came onto the Australian Stock Exchange at A$12.492 on Monday, 14.2 cents above the institutional issue price of A$12.35 and 54.2 cents above the retail issue price of A$11.95.</p>
<p>The shares are trading under a deferred setttlement basis.</p>
</text>
